MSG_ABOUT_SEC_SERVER
VortexBrowser for AmigaOS 4\nVersion 0.99 RC3\n\n=== SERVER INFORMATION ===\nServer Address: %s:%u\nConnection Status: %s\nServer Engine: Chromium (Linux Headless Streaming)\n\n
;
MSG_ABOUT_SEC_GRAPHICS
=== RESOLUTION & GRAPHICS ===\nScreen: %ux%u (%u-bit, %s)\nWindow Size: %ux%u (Pos: %d,%d)\nBrowser Viewport: %ux%u px (1:1 Auto-Sync)\nServer Stream: %ux%u (%s)\nDecoded Frames: %u\nActive Language: %s\n\n
;
MSG_ABOUT_SEC_AUDIO
=== AUDIO & OPTIMIZATION ===\nAudio Engine: AHI 16-Bit Stereo (44100 Hz CD Quality PCM Low-Latency)\nCPU Target: PowerPC Universal (Dynamic CPU Detection)\nVector SIMD: %s\nCompression: LZ4 Realtime Stream Decompressor
;
MSG_ABOUT_TITLE
About VortexBrowser
;
MSG_CPU_INCOMPAT_TITLE
VortexBrowser - Incompatible CPU
;
MSG_CPU_INCOMPAT_BODY
This build ('VortexBrowser-AltiVec') requires a CPU with an AltiVec/VMX SIMD unit (e.g. AmigaOne X1000 or G4).\n\nOn systems such as AmigaOne X5000, A1222+, Sam460 or G3, please launch the standard 'VortexBrowser' build!
;
